          {
           "type": "heading",
           "level": 1,
           "html": "About Kalama",
           "align": "center",
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "\"Fire in my heart, fire in my soul,",
           "align": "right",
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "Watch me dance where the flames roll.",
           "align": "right",
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "Tarot cards laid beneath Mars' sky,",
           "align": "right",
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "In this sacred dance, watch spirits fly.\"",
           "align": "right",
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "&nbsp;",
           "blank": true,
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          },
          {
           "type": "paragraph",
           "html": "Kalama resides within the fiery heart of Olympus Mons on Mars, where they manipulate the volcano’s geothermal energy to forge sanctuaries of life. With the spirit of Pele, the goddess of fire, echoing in every crafted ecosystem, Kalama is a master of elemental alchemy. Their domain, rich with volcanic minerals, is transformed into fertile grounds where extremophiles flourish. In the Imaginarium, Kalama curates tales of fiery creation and destruction, their work a vibrant testament to the enduring power and creativity of fire.",
           "align": null,
           "size": null
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
